"types>` in Odoo. However, you can choose from 20 field types in Studio, as "
"some field types are available more than once with a different default "
"widget;"
msgstr ""
":ref:`dodajte nova polja <studio/fields/add-new>` v svojo podatkovno zbirko. "
"S tehničnega vidika je v Odoo 15 :ref:`vrst polj <studio/fields/field-types>"
"`. V Studiu pa lahko izbirate med 20 vrstami polj, saj so nekatere vrste "
"polj na voljo večkrat z drugim privzetim gradnikom;"

